#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:15
msgid "Use Default Font"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນມາດຕະຖານ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"Whether to use the system's default fixed width font for editing text "
"instead of a font specific to pluma. If this option is turned off, then the "
"font named in the \"Editor Font\" option will be used instead of the system "
"font."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຈະໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນຄວາມກວ້າງຄົງທີ່ມາດຕະຖານຂອງລະບົບເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນສະເພາະ"
"ຂອງ pluma ຫຼື ບໍ່. ຫາກປິດຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ລະບຸໃນຕົວເລືອກ \"Editor Font\" ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:19
msgctxt "editor-font"
msgid "'Monospace 12'"
msgstr "'Monospace 12'"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:20
msgid "Editor Font"
msgstr "ຕົວອັກສອນຂອງຕົວແກ້ໄຂ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:21
msgid ""
"A custom font that will be used for the editing area. This will only take "
"effect if the \"Use Default Font\" option is turned off."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວອັກສອນກຳນົດເອງທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນສ່ວນການແກ້ໄຂ. ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຕົວເລືອກ \"Use Default Font\" ຖືກ"
"ປິດໄວ້."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:25
msgid "Switch tabs with [ctrl] + [tab]"
msgstr "ສະຫຼັບແທັບດ້ວຍ [ctrl] + [tab]"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:26
msgid ""
"If true, it enables the ability to switch tabs using [ctrl + tab] and [ctrl "
"+ shift + tab]."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເລືອກ, ຈະສາມາດສະຫຼັບແທັບໂດຍໃຊ້ [ctrl + tab] ແລະ [ctrl + shift + tab] ໄດ້."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:30
msgid "Show the first tab if there is only one tab"
msgstr "ສະແດງແທັບທຳອິດຫາກມີພຽງແທັບດຽວ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:31
msgid "If false, it hides the first tab if there is only one tab."
msgstr "ຫາກບໍ່ເລືອກ, ຈະເຊື່ອງແທັບທຳອິດຫາກມີພຽງແທັບດຽວ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:35
msgid "Style Scheme"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຊຸດສີ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:36
msgid "The ID of a GtkSourceView Style Scheme used to color the text."
msgstr "ໄອດີຂອງ GtkSourceView Style Scheme ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສະແດງສີຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:40
msgid "Create Backup Copies"
msgstr "ສ້າງສຳເນົາສຳຮອງ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:41
msgid ""
"Whether pluma should create backup copies for the files it saves. You can "
"set the backup file extension with the \"Backup Copy Extension\" option."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ pluma ສ້າງສຳເນົາສຳຮອງສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບັນທຶກຫຼືບໍ່. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ສຳຮອງໄດ້ໃນຕົວເລື"
"ອກ \"Backup Copy Extension\"."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:45
msgid "Autosave"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:46
msgid ""
"Whether pluma should automatically save modified files after a time "
"interval. You can set the time interval with the \"Autosave Interval\" "
"option."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ pluma ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດຫຼືບໍ່. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງໄລຍະເວລ"
"າໄດ້ໃນຕົວເລືອກ \"Autosave Interval\"."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:50
msgid "Autosave Interval"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາບັນທຶກອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:51
msgid ""
"Number of minutes after which pluma will automatically save modified files. "
"This will only take effect if the \"Autosave\" option is turned on."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນນາທີທີ່ pluma ຈະບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຕົວເລືອກ \"Autosave\" ຖືກ"
"ເປີດໄວ້."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:55
msgid "Show save confirmation"
msgstr "ສະແດງການຢືນຢັນການບັນທຶກ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:56
msgid "Show save confirmation if the files have changes."
msgstr "ສະແດງການຢືນຢັນການບັນທຶກຫາກໄຟລ໌ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:60
msgid "Writable VFS schemes"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ VFS ທີ່ຂຽນໄດ້"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:61
msgid ""
"List of VFS schemes pluma supports in write mode. The 'file' scheme is "
"writable by default."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍຊື່ຮູບແບບ VFS ທີ່ pluma ຮອງຮັບໃນໂໝດການຂຽນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຮູບແບບ 'file' ແມ່ນສາມາດຂຽນໄດ້ຢູ່ແລ້"
"ວ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:65
msgid "Maximum Number of Undo Actions"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງການຍົກເລີກການກະທຳ (Undo)"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:66
msgid ""
"Maximum number of actions that pluma will be able to undo or redo. Use "
"\"-1\" for unlimited number of actions."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງການກະທຳທີ່ pluma ສາມາດຍົກເລີກ (undo) ຫຼື ເຮັດຄືນ (redo) ໄດ້. ໃຊ້ \"-1\" ສຳລັ"
"ບການກະທຳແບບບໍ່ຈຳກັດ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:70
msgid "Line Wrapping Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດການຕັດຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:71
msgid ""
"Specifies how to wrap long lines in the editing area. Use \"GTK_WRAP_NONE\" "
"for no wrapping, \"GTK_WRAP_WORD\" for wrapping at word boundaries, and "
"\"GTK_WRAP_CHAR\" for wrapping at individual character boundaries. Note that "
"the values are case-sensitive, so make sure they appear exactly as mentioned "
"here."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວິທີການຕັດແຖວທີ່ຍາວໃນສ່ວນການແກ້ໄຂ. ໃຊ້ \"GTK_WRAP_NONE\" ສຳລັບການບໍ່ຕັດແຖວ, "
"\"GTK_WRAP_WORD\" ສຳລັບການຕັດແຖວຕາມຂອບເຂດຄຳສັບ, ແລະ \"GTK_WRAP_CHAR\" ສຳລັບການຕັດແ"
"ຖວຕາມຕົວອັກສອນ. ໝາຍເຫດ: ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງຂຽນໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:75
msgid "Tab Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດແທັບ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:76
msgid ""
"Specifies the number of spaces that should be displayed instead of Tab "
"characters."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຈຳນວນຍະຫວ່າງທີ່ຈະສະແດງແທນຕົວອັກສອນແທັບ (Tab)."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:80
msgid "Insert spaces"
msgstr "ແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:81
msgid "Whether pluma should insert spaces instead of tabs."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ pluma ໃສ່ຍະຫວ່າງແທນທີ່ແທັບຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:85
msgid "Automatic indent"
msgstr "ຫຍໍ້ໜ້າອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:86
msgid "Whether pluma should enable automatic indentation."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ pluma ເປີດໃຊ້ການຫຍໍ້ໜ້າອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:90
msgid "Display Line Numbers"
msgstr "ສະແດງເລກແຖວ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:91
msgid "Whether pluma should display line numbers in the editing area."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ pluma ສະແດງເລກແຖວໃນສ່ວນການແກ້ໄຂຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:95
msgid "Highlight Current Line"
msgstr "ເນັ້ນແຖວປັດຈຸບັນ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:96
msgid "Whether pluma should highlight the current line."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ pluma ເນັ້ນແຖວທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:100
msgid "Highlight Matching Bracket"
msgstr "ເນັ້ນວົງເລັບທີ່ຄູ່ກັນ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:101
msgid "Whether pluma should highlight the bracket matching the selected one."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ pluma ເນັ້ນວົງເລັບທີ່ເຂົ້າຄູ່ກັບວົງເລັບທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:105
msgid "Display Right Margin"
msgstr "ສະແດງຂອບຂວາ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:106
msgid "Whether pluma should display the right margin in the editing area."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ pluma ສະແດງເສັ້ນຂອບຂວາໃນສ່ວນການແກ້ໄຂຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:110
msgid "Right Margin Position"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອບຂວາ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:111
msgid "Specifies the position of the right margin."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບຂວາ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:115
msgid "Document background pattern type"
msgstr "ປະເພດລວດລາຍພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງເອກະສານ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:116
msgid "Whether the document will get a background pattern painted."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າເອກະສານຈະມີລວດລາຍພື້ນຫຼັງຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:120
msgid "Display Overview Map"
msgstr "ສະແດງແຜນທີ່ພາບລວມ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:121
msgid "Whether pluma should display the overview map for the document."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ pluma ສະແດງແຜນທີ່ພາບລວມຂອງເອກະສານຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:125
msgid "Smart Home End"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມ Home End ອັດສະລິຍະ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:126
msgid ""
"Specifies how the cursor moves when the HOME and END keys are pressed. Use "
"\"DISABLED\" to always move at the start/end of the line, \"AFTER\" to move "
"to the start/end of the line the first time the keys are pressed and to the "
"start/end of the text ignoring whitespaces the second time the keys are "
"pressed, \"BEFORE\" to move to the start/end of the text before moving to "
"the start/end of the line and \"ALWAYS\" to always move to the start/end of "
"the text instead of the start/end of the line."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວິທີການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍເຄີເຊີເມື່ອປຸ່ມ HOME ແລະ END ຖືກກົດ. ໃຊ້ \"DISABLED\" ເພື່ອໄປທີ່ຕົ້ນ/ທ້າຍແຖວສ"
"ະເໝີ, \"AFTER\" ເພື່ອໄປທີ່ຕົ້ນ/ທ້າຍແຖວໃນການກົດຄັ້ງທຳອິດ ແລະ ໄປທີ່ຕົ້ນ/ທ້າຍຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຍະຫວ່"
"າງໃນການກົດຄັ້ງທີສອງ, \"BEFORE\" ເພື່ອໄປທີ່ຕົ້ນ/ທ້າຍຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມກ່ອນຈະໄປທີ່ຕົ້ນ/ທ້າຍແຖວ ແລະ "
"\"ALWAYS\" ເພື່ອໄປທີ່ຕົ້ນ/ທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມສະເໝີ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:130
msgid "Restore Previous Cursor Position"
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:131
msgid ""
"Whether pluma should restore the previous cursor position when a file is "
"loaded."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ pluma ຄືນຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງເຄີເຊີຫຼ້າສຸດເມື່ອໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຂຶ້ນມາຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:135
msgid "Enable Search Highlighting"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການເນັ້ນຄຳຄົ້ນຫາ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:136
msgid ""
"Whether pluma should highlight all the occurrences of the searched text."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ pluma ເນັ້ນຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດທີ່ກົງກັບຄຳທີ່ຄົ້ນຫາຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:140
msgid "Enable Syntax Highlighting"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:141
msgid "Whether pluma should enable syntax highlighting."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ pluma ເປີດໃຊ້ການເນັ້ນສີໄວຍາກອນຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:145
msgid "Toolbar is Visible"
msgstr "ສະແດງແຖບເຄື່ອງມື"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:146
msgid "Whether the toolbar should be visible in editing windows."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ສະແດງແຖບເຄື່ອງມືໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການແກ້ໄຂຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:150
msgid "Toolbar Buttons Style"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບປຸ່ມເທິງແຖບເຄື່ອງມື"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:151
msgid ""
"Style for the toolbar buttons. Possible values are \"PLUMA_TOOLBAR_SYSTEM\" "
"to use the system's default style, \"PLUMA_TOOLBAR_ICONS\" to display icons "
"only, \"PLUMA_TOOLBAR_ICONS_AND_TEXT\" to display both icons and text, and "
"\"PLUMA_TOOLBAR_ICONS_BOTH_HORIZ\" to display prioritized text beside icons. "
"Note that the values are case-sensitive, so make sure they appear exactly as "
"mentioned here."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບປຸ່ມແຖບເຄື່ອງມື. ຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ຄື \"PLUMA_TOOLBAR_SYSTEM\" ໃຊ້ຕາມລະບົບ, "
"\"PLUMA_TOOLBAR_ICONS\" ສະແດງແຕ່ໄອຄອນ, \"PLUMA_TOOLBAR_ICONS_AND_TEXT\" ສະແດງທັ"
"ງໄອຄອນແລະຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ແລະ \"PLUMA_TOOLBAR_ICONS_BOTH_HORIZ\" ສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຂ້າງໄອຄອນ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:155
msgid "Status Bar is Visible"
msgstr "ສະແດງແຖບສະຖານະ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:156
msgid ""
"Whether the status bar at the bottom of editing windows should be visible."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ສະແດງແຖບສະຖານະຢູ່ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງການແກ້ໄຂຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:160
msgid "Side Pane is Visible"
msgstr "ສະແດງແຖບຂ້າງ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:161
msgid "Whether the side pane at the left of editing windows should be visible."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ສະແດງແຖບຂ້າງທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງການແກ້ໄຂຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:165
msgid "Show tabs with side pane"
msgstr "ສະແດງແທັບພ້ອມກັບແຖບຂ້າງ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:166
msgid ""
"If false, pluma doesn't show tabs in the notebook with the side pane active."
msgstr "ຫາກບໍ່ເລືອກ, pluma ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງແທັບໃນສະໝຸດບັນທຶກເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານແຖບຂ້າງ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:170
msgid "Bottom Panel is Visible"
msgstr "ສະແດງແຖບດ້ານລຸ່ມ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:171
msgid ""
"Whether the bottom panel at the bottom of editing windows should be visible."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ສະແດງແຖບດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງການແກ້ໄຂຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:175
msgid "Right Panel is Visible"
msgstr "ສະແດງແຖບດ້ານຂວາ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:176
msgid ""
"Whether the right panel at the right of editing windows should be visible."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ສະແດງແຖບດ້ານຂວາຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງການແກ້ໄຂຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:180
msgid "Maximum Recent Files"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງໄຟລ໌ຫຼ້າສຸດ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:181
msgid ""
"Specifies the maximum number of recently opened files that will be displayed "
"in the \"Recent Files\" submenu."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຫາກໍເປີດ ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງໃນເມນູຍ່ອຍ \"Recent Files\"."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:185
msgid "Print Syntax Highlighting"
msgstr "ພິມການເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:186
msgid "Whether pluma should print syntax highlighting when printing documents."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ pluma ພິມສີເນັ້ນໄວຍາກອນນຳຫຼືບໍ່ເມື່ອພິມເອກະສານ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:190
msgid "Print Header"
msgstr "ພິມຫົວຂໍ້ແຖວ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:191
msgid "Whether pluma should include a document header when printing documents."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ pluma ໃສ່ຫົວເອກະສານນຳຫຼືບໍ່ເມື່ອພິມເອກະສານ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:195
msgid "Printing Line Wrapping Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດການຕັດແຖວໃນການພິມ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:196
msgid ""
"Specifies how to wrap long lines for printing. Use \"GTK_WRAP_NONE\" for no "
"wrapping, \"GTK_WRAP_WORD\" for wrapping at word boundaries, and "
"\"GTK_WRAP_CHAR\" for wrapping at individual character boundaries. Note that "
"the values are case-sensitive, so make sure they appear exactly as mentioned "
"here."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວິທີການຕັດແຖວທີ່ຍາວສຳລັບການພິມ. ໃຊ້ \"GTK_WRAP_NONE\" ບໍ່ຕັດແຖວ, \"GTK_WRAP_WORD\" ຕັ"
"ດຕາມຄຳສັບ, ແລະ \"GTK_WRAP_CHAR\" ຕັດຕາມຕົວອັກສອນ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:200
msgid "Print Line Numbers"
msgstr "ພິມເລກແຖວ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:201
msgid ""
"If this value is 0, then no line numbers will be inserted when printing a "
"document. Otherwise, pluma will print line numbers every such number of "
"lines."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຄ່ານີ້ແມ່ນ 0 ຈະບໍ່ມີການພິມເລກແຖວ. ຫາກເປັນຄ່າອື່ນ pluma ຈະພິມເລກແຖວຕາມໄລຍະແຖວທີ່ລະບຸ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:204
msgctxt "print-font-body-pango"
msgid "'Monospace 9'"
msgstr "'Monospace 9'"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:205
msgid "Body Font for Printing"
msgstr "ຕົວອັກສອນເນື້ອໃນສຳລັບການພິມ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:206
msgid ""
"Specifies the font to use for a document's body when printing documents."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນສ່ວນເນື້ອໃນຂອງເອກະສານເມື່ອພິມ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:209
msgctxt "print-font-header-pango"
msgid "'Sans 11'"
msgstr "'Sans 11'"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:210
msgid "Header Font for Printing"
msgstr "ຕົວອັກສອນຫົວເອກະສານສຳລັບການພິມ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:211
msgid ""
"Specifies the font to use for page headers when printing a document. This "
"will only take effect if the \"Print Header\" option is turned on."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຫົວໜ້າເອກະສານເມື່ອພິມ. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ \"Print Header\"."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:214
msgctxt "print-font-numbers-pango"
msgid "'Sans 8'"
msgstr "'Sans 8'"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:215
msgid "Line Number Font for Printing"
msgstr "ຕົວອັກສອນເລກແຖວສຳລັບການພິມ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:216
msgid ""
"Specifies the font to use for line numbers when printing. This will only "
"take effect if the \"Print Line Numbers\" option is non-zero."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບເລກແຖວເມື່ອພິມ. ຈະມີຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຕົວເລືອກ \"Print Line Numbers\" ບໍ່ແມ່"
"ນ 0."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:219
msgctxt "auto-detected"
msgid "[ 'UTF-8', 'GBK', 'CURRENT', 'ISO-8859-15', 'UTF-16' ]"
msgstr "[ 'UTF-8', 'GBK', 'CURRENT', 'ISO-8859-15', 'UTF-16' ]"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:220
msgid "Automatically Detected Encodings"
msgstr "ກວດຫາລະຫັດຕົວອັກສອນອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:221
msgid ""
"Sorted list of encodings used by pluma for automatically detecting the "
"encoding of a file. \"CURRENT\" represents the current locale encoding. Only "
"recognized encodings are used."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການລະຫັດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການກວດຫາອັດຕະໂນມັດ. \"CURRENT\" ແມ່ນລະຫັດຕົວອັກສອນປັດຈຸບັນຂອງລະບົ"
"ບ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:224
msgctxt "shown-in-menu"
msgid "[ 'ISO-8859-15' ]"
msgstr "[ 'ISO-8859-15' ]"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:225
msgid "Encodings shown in menu"
msgstr "ລະຫັດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ສະແດງໃນເມນູ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:226
msgid ""
"List of encodings shown in the Character Encoding menu in open/save file "
"selector. Only recognized encodings are used."
msgstr "ລາຍການລະຫັດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນເມນູຕອນເປີດ/ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:230
msgid "History for \"search for\" entries"
msgstr "ປະຫວັດການຄົ້ນຫາ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:231
msgid "List of entries in \"search for\" textbox."
msgstr "ລາຍການຄຳຄົ້ນຫາໃນຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:235
msgid "History for \"replace with\" entries"
msgstr "ປະຫວັດການແທນທີ່"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:236
msgid "List of entries in \"replace with\" textbox."
msgstr "ລາຍການຄຳທີ່ໃຊ້ແທນທີ່ໃນຊ່ອງແທັນທີ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:240
msgid "Active plugins"
msgstr "ປລັກອິນທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:241
msgid ""
"List of active plugins. It contains the \"Location\" of the active plugins. "
"See the .pluma-plugin file for obtaining the \"Location\" of a given plugin."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ປລັກອິນທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດໃຊ້."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:245
msgid "Show newline"
msgstr "ສະແດງການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:246
msgid "Whether pluma should show newlines in the editor window."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໃຫ້ pluma ສະແດງສັນຍະລັກການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງແກ້ໄຂຫຼືບໍ່."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:250
msgid "Show nbsp"
msgstr "ສະແດງຍະຫວ່າງແບບບໍ່ຕັດແຖວ (nbsp)"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:251
msgid ""
"Whether pluma should show not breaking spaces in the editor window: 'show-"
"none' no showing; 'show-trailing' showing only trailing spaces; 'show-all' "
"showing all spaces."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດການສະແດງຍະຫວ່າງແບບບໍ່ຕັດແຖວ: 'show-none' ບໍ່ສະແດງ; 'show-trailing' ສະແດງສະເພາະຍ"
"ະຫວ່າງທ້າຍແຖວ; 'show-all' ສະແດງທັງໝົດ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:255
msgid "Show tabs"
msgstr "ສະແດງແທັບ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:256
msgid ""
"Whether pluma should show tabs in the editor window: 'show-none' no showing; "
"'show-trailing' showing only trailing spaces; 'show-all' showing all spaces."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດການສະແດງແທັບ: 'show-none' ບໍ່ສະແດງ; 'show-trailing' ສະແດງສະເພາະແທັບທ້າຍແຖວ; "
"'show-all' ສະແດງທັງໝົດ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:260
msgid "Show spaces"
msgstr "ສະແດງຍະຫວ່າງ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:261
msgid ""
"Whether pluma should show spaces in the editor window: 'show-none' no "
"showing; 'show-trailing' showing only trailing spaces; 'show-all' showing "
"all spaces."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດການສະແດງຍະຫວ່າງ: 'show-none' ບໍ່ສະແດງ; 'show-trailing' ສະແດງສະເພາະຍະຫວ່າງທ້າຍແ"
"ຖວ; 'show-all' ສະແດງທັງໝົດ."

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:265
msgid "state"
msgstr "ສະຖານະ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:266
msgid "The pluma window state"
msgstr "ສະຖານະໜ້າຕ່າງຂອງ pluma"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:270
msgid "size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:271
msgid "The pluma window size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງຂອງ pluma"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:275
msgid "side-panel-size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດແຖບຂ້າງ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:276
msgid "The pluma side-panel-size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດແຖບຂ້າງຂອງ pluma"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:280
msgid "side-panel-active-page"
msgstr "ໜ້າທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໃນແຖບຂ້າງ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:281
msgid "The pluma side-panel-active-page"
msgstr "ໜ້າທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານໃນແຖບຂ້າງຂອງ pluma"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:285
msgid "bottom-panel-size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດແຖບດ້ານລຸ່ມ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:286
msgid "The pluma bottom-panel-size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດແຖບດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງ pluma"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:290
msgid "bottom-panel-active-page"
msgstr "ໜ້າທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໃນແຖບດ້ານລຸ່ມ"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:291
msgid "The pluma bottom-panel-active-page"
msgstr "ໜ້າທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານໃນແຖບດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງ pluma"

#: data/org.mate.pluma.gschema.xml.in:295
